From 102114fea355bc240777246ea46bfc2a58955768 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
Date: Fri, 30 Sep 2022 12:39:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-69872] gaudi3: d2d: sync d2d init for both dies

In order to make sure both dies start initialization for d2d
link together, a sync mechanism is added.

This is because usually, slave will reach d2d init earlier than
master due to less processing compared to master.

Change-Id: Id5d6fa8ec9184c3d1e66dc5eb0434384135812d2
---

